  "description": "The Firetrail 2.0 specification is unmatched at this price point and the perfect way to get into gravel riding, cx racing, bikepacking, or just hacking the commute in style.\nWith a full complement of mudguard and equipment mounts, a carbon through axle fork, and clearance for 40c tyres, the frameset has an impressive spec.\nThe double butted 6061 frame is built to be light and stiff giving great control on both road and the rough stuff. LTWOO integrated road shifters with a 1×11 GR9 group set provide a big range that covers the ups and downs of any ride with ease. The integrated shifters allow easy and safe access to gear changes whilst covering the brakes from both the top and drops of the bars. Braking is provided by stopping experts Tektro with cable disc brakes for awesome control in all weathers.\nThe Firetrail 2.0 is finished with a Selle Royal saddle, Kenda 40C tyres, and high quality Reid bar tape to ensure your bike stays comfortable all ride. Go out and hit those fire trails!",
